abstract: >-
  Reproduction code, experiment scripts and the sealed JSON artefacts behind every number in
  "Timing-Feasibility Constraints for LEO Handover: Attribution, Calibration and Audit in a Digital
  Twin": a 350-satellite SGP4 twin, a censoring-aware constraint miner, a deployed-policy probe, a
  counterfactual replay gate, and the figures and tables of the paper.
